Package: pmdplan
Type: Package
Title: Generate and Evaluate Planned Missing Data Designs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Yilan", "Chen", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "yilanchen83@gmail.com")
Author: Yilan Chen [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Yilan Chen <yilanchen83@gmail.com>
Description: Applies planned item-form and measurement-occasion missingness to
    existing longitudinal data, optionally across replications in parallel.
    Evaluates existing Mplus output, posterior chains, or user-supplied estimates
    using a common convergence and performance workflow. Calls Mplus to generate
    complete replicated data using a two-factor dynamic structural equation model
    template or custom model syntax, and analyzes existing datasets with Mplus
    in parallel. Includes configurable
    screening criteria and software-independent result schemas. Provides an
    empirical affect dataset with 76 measurements per participant for PMD examples.
